Document upload target for the staging DMS.

This directory is web-reachable and PHP-executable by design -- it is the
Stage 3 payload landing zone. install/install.sh creates it owned by www-data
with mode 0755, and install/lockdown.sh empties it between classes.

Keep this file so the directory survives a git clone. It is denied over HTTP
by the dotfile rule in the vhost.
